column1:
If I am not herded out thru the boarding gate in this scorching heat in Darbhanga even before the aircraft has been unloaded and cleaned for next trip, 

if I'm not made to wait in this scorching heat outside the terminal building for the aircraft which is still being cleaned for the flights I will take,
if I don't have to wait 1hr 20 minutes at the belt to get my bag upon arrival,

my experience could become way better, because the crew are good enough; but they don't make up the whole of my experience.

1. Drinking water must be offered atleast for 2-times while in 2-hrs journey ( even though people are carrying with them);
2. To avoid laziness/ sleeping, pls try to distribute toffee to the passengers (atleast one per passenger);
Thanks,
